# §38.1 control-plane bake-off prototype (dra#37) — NON-CANONICAL.
# The hand-written deliverables (workflow, variants, results ledger, tests)
# ARE committed so they survive a workspace reset and are reviewable at the
# branch checkout. Only the heavy regenerable DeerFlow clone + runtime
# artifacts are gitignored. The dra wheel is unaffected: packaging uses
# `[tool.setuptools.packages.find] where = ["src"]`, so nothing outside src/
# is packaged (verified by the wheel smoke-check). See bake-off/README.md.
bake-off/_corpus/
bake-off/__pycache__/
bake-off/**/__pycache__/
bake-off/.pytest_cache/
# Vendored DeerFlow 2 clone — regenerable, gitignored (heavy).
bake-off/variant_c_deerflow/deerflow/
